OL,3,GNEWSANew buses part of plan to deliver
OL,4,Areliable service
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new buses due to begin service in
OL,7,Fthe next couple of weeks will help
OL,8,Fimprove the island's service, a
OL,9,FStagecoach boss has said.
OL,11,FManaging director Peter Knight
OL,12,Facknowledged there had been "a couple
OL,13,Fof challenges" in recent months in
OL,14,FGuernsey, but insisted "things are in a
OL,15,Fbetter place".
OL,17,FHe and the president of the Environment
OL,18,Fand Infrastructure Committee, Adrian
OL,19,FGabriel, met last week after complaints
OL,20,Fabout delayed and cancelled bus
OL,21,Fjourneys in recent months.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
