OL,3,GNEWSANew buses part of plan to deliver
OL,4,Areliable service
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnight said the firm was recruiting
OL,7,Fmore drivers and extending the
OL,8,FStagecoach shop's and telephone line's
OL,9,Fopening times in order to deliver "the
OL,10,Freliable and dependable service"
OL,11,Fpassengers wanted.
